# agentcore CLI state. NOT committed: `entrypoint` and `source_path` are
# absolute paths to whoever ran `agentcore configure` last, so committing this
# hands teammates a config pointing at a directory they do not have. Each
# person runs `agentcore configure` themselves -- the exact command is in
# docs/DEPLOY.md. Holds no secrets, just machine-local paths and the agent id.
.bedrock_agentcore.yaml
.bedrock_agentcore/
